WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.120
Summer vacation is coming up!

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:51.220
Morning.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.890
Let's go bug catching!

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.610
Go catch them yourself.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.060
You're as cold as always.

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:01.340
C'mon, let's go!

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:02.740
Oh? Am I <i>bugging</i> you?

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:04.390
<i>Bugging</i> you?

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.490
Got you!

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.450
But you said go catching myself...

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.540
Don't make up terrible puns!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.750
After school.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.670
Now then, let's go catch some bugs!

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:20.480
You still haven't given up?

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.960
Come on!

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:26.430
Don't you want to see all the bugs gathering around sugar water?

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.840
Not really.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:30.450
Here. Put it wherever you'd like.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.110
What are you doing?!

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:41.820
The bugs are gonna come!

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.240
You told me to put it wherever I wanted.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.380
If you don't put it on a tree, there's no point!

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.250
Sheesh.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:55.540
But now that you've tried it, it's kinda fun, huh?

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.460
Not at all.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.030
Damn it!

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.690
Besides, what exactly about bug catching is fun?

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:03.380
It's fun! Probably!

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.260
I'd rather not touch them at all.

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.130
Me neither!

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.720
Then why did you invite me along?!

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:14.180
I thought if I found any, you could catch them for me.

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:16.720
W-Wait!

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.650
I actually already coated the tree in the back yard this morning!

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:22.390
If they gathered, I'll catch them.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:23.420
Okay?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.370
Well? Go and get 'em.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:35.290
Woah! That one's awesome!

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:34.590
Yes.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.410
Maybe it's a new species!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.380
It would be amazing if I could catch it...

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.150
Seriously?

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.930
Sonya-chan, aren't you glad?

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:45.670
Now it's your time to shi—

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:46.380
Ouch!

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.030
You go yourself.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.260
No helping it.

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.680
We'll use this!

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:54.680
You're going to just kill them all using that bug spray?

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:56.180
No.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.810
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:00.400
Don't worry! This is just insect repellent.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:00.940
Oh.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.300
Now we're like an invincible soldiers!

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.690
Go, go! Sonya!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.240
You're invincible now, go and get 'em.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.390
This is dangerous, so please don't do it.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.240
What are you doing?

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.560
Did you think that would protect you against bees?

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.500
You little... I knew it!

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.640
Why is it coming after me?!

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.380
Bees can see people too.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:30.820
Don't just stand there and watch, help me!

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.720
I don't know about that...

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.220
It's a weird bird!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.570
It saved me...

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.150
What kind of bird is this?

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.420
Sorry. Could you help me out?

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.160
Huh? That's weird.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.460
Maybe because I was hit on the head?

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.550
No, I heard it too.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.140
It's me! Agiri!

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:59.080
Oh, it's you, Agiri-san.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.910
Hey, that's weird too.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:03.630
This is a ninja technique.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:05.770
Th-This too?!

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.110
No way!

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.710
But it <i>is</i> Agiri's voice.

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.040
I don't believe it...

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.260
To think she can take the form of a bird...

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:18.110
It's me! Agiri!

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:21.850
Huh? I think I've seen this bird before.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:25.440
Oh, it's just a gracula that she raised.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:29.620
Oh. It's just mimicking Agiri-san's voice.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.400
It's normal for a gracula to do that.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:37.060
No, it really is me talking.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.590
Take a closer look.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:40.910
A-At what?

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:45.290
There's a small transmitter that allows me to talk.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.290
That's so confusing...

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.130
So, what are you doing?

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:57.720
The truth is, I've been practicing my ninjutsu on that tree since this morning.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:02.530
But then a bunch of bees came and now I'm stuck up there.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.930
I-I didn't notice.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.730
She's good.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.480
Okay.

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:11.460
Agiri-san, I'll chase away the bees right away!

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.410
No, that's...

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.360
Don't worry. When they get too close, we'll just run away.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:17.240
Wait—!

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.560
Ah! I'm sorry!

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.160
—wait, substitution jutsu?

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:26.490
So where the heck's the real one?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.250
Ta-da!

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:37.640
"The substitution was actually the real one" jutsu!

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.370
Are you okay?

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.460
You hit my substitution.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.770
Wait, how does that work?

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.410
Another day.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:02.480
Sonya-chan, looks like they're having a festival!

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.160
I've never been to one before.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.540
Then let's go check it out.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.740
Oh yeah, do you have money?

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:11.750
Are you out?

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.470
No! But I thought we'd buy some food and show it off!

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:19.010
Sorry, but I don't have much.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.300
Gold fish scooping first!

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:27.910
I couldn't help one?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.980
Whatever, I'll just try it again!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.840
You suck at this.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.240
You try it, then!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.200
That was easy.

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.420
Run!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.000
I saved the goldfish from the hands of a demon.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.540
Who are you calling a demon?!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.420
Here.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.910
I'll give this to you, so don't fight.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:01.970
They felt bad, so they didn't take it.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:09.190
Win!

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.370
Lose!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:18.080
I'm on a losing streak, so I'll just stop.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.820
Everything but food here is gambling.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:28.620
I want that doll...

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.110
You know the ring toss is also gambling, right?

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.380
This is just a test of my skills, so it's fine!

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.210
<i>She's such a gambler.</i>

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:41.240
Ah! Again!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.010
I guess it's no good.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:45.930
I only have one left...

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:48.500
I'll just close my eyes and toss it.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.100
<i>Yet more dumb ideas...</i>

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.460
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:57.230
Be sure to look when you throw, missy.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:00.030
Alright! This time will be a double toss!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.720
I'll give you one, Sonya-chan, so help out!

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.240
Why me?

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:06.870
Ready, and...

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:09.750
Don't get in the way!

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:14.440
Missy, you haven't got it once, so if you can hit it, I'll give it to you.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:15.500
Really?!

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:17.420
Sonya-chan, please!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.840
I'm begging you!

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:20.040
Again?

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.720
Toss it with all your might!

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:29.320
Why did this have to happen...

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:33.440
At any rate, there are a lot of stalls here.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.690
A-A sniper snuck into the festival!

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:39.900
Calm down! It's just target practice!

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.590
I'm hungry.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.590
Because we've been walking around a lot.

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:47.710
I'm going to go buy some takoyaki!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:53.840
Hey!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.000
I am an assassin!

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.920
If you're not nice to Yasuna, I'll have to take you out!

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.570
Weren't you going to get takoyaki?

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:06.690
I was, but on the way there, I saw a mask stand.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.900
But I didn't buy it!

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.710
But after that, I won a prize draw!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.680
After trying five times...

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.300
Waste of money...

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:23.260
Since I'm here, I might as well buy one.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.280
Good idea! I'll buy one too.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.850
Ah! I don't have anymore money!

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.760
Because you kept buying useless stuff.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.800
Hey, do you wanna trad—

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:36.630
No.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.590
Look! Look at how cool I look!

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:45.040
Truth is, you've wanted this from the start, huh?

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.470
If you want to trade, I don't mind!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.060
D-Don't eat any more than that!

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:51.870
Do you not know how charming this is?!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:53.270
So cool!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.140
What's with you kids?

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:58.080
If you want this mask, go bug your mom to buy it for you!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.230
Isn't that nice? They see how charming you are.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:04.240
What a sucker!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.680
They took it...

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.290
They were happy, so who cares?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.830
It's already dark out.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.770
I thought I had some money left...

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:17.160
Oh!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:18.670
I do!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.630
I'm gonna go buy some takoyaki!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.020
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:25.380
Look, look!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:26.840
<i>Thought so.</i>

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:29.150
Huh? No response?

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.790
I'm used to it at this point.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:32.940
I'll shoot you!

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.470
It's just a noiseless toy.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:40.620
Boom!

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:44.960
Summer vacation.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.630
Task completed. I'm returning to base.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.670
Found you, Sonya-chan!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.480
What are you doing?!

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.570
And what are you doing with that net?

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.010
Let's catch fish with it!

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.510
What about fishing is fun?

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:11.420
It's fun! Probably!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.160
I'd rather not touch them.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:14.890
Me neither!

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.980
Then why did you invite me along?!

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.140
I thought if I found any, you could catch them for me.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:24.700
I was kidding, Sonya-chan!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.650
If I see any, I'll grab them myself!

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:29.320
So here... huh?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.820
It wasn't on purpo...

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:53.800
Hey, Sonya-chan.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.550
If we can't catch any fish, wanna go swimming?

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:58.860
I mean, we have the beach all to ourselves.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.890
I swam enough today.

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:03.970
Let's at least do something beach-like, then!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:07.000
Let's run across and pretend we're a couple.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.460
That's so dumb.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.770
See, it's like we're a couple!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.070
How?!

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:24.940
This is bad.

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:25.990
We're stuck here.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:28.370
It's okay.

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.390
I knew this might happen!

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:34.710
Fish sausage!

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.120
When I throw this, we can use that time to run.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:38.090
Good idea!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.680
Fish sausage...!

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.720
H-Huh?

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.430
You threw it too far!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:53.890
Not on purpose!

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.280
I know!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.730
If we bark back, it may get scared and run off!

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:00.730
Please, Sonya-chan!

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:03.820
A-Alright.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:08.660
What are you trying to make me do?!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.120
Ow!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.940
You could've at least tried to bark once.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.790
What are you doing?

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.250
Agiri-san!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.980
What are you doing with that sausage!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.760
It came flying while I was walking.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:29.260
Agiri-san, use some ninja technique to get rid of this dog.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.730
Okay.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.150
Hello?

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.280
Are you the pet owner?

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:46.760
Thank you very much for finding my dog.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:47.870
This isn't much, but...

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.120
Oh, you don't need to.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.330
Is that so?

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.540
But I'll take it.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:57.140
Wow! What a nice ninja technique.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:00.000
No, that wasn't a ninja technique.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:06.550
Since we're at the beach,

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.180
how about we try digging for clams?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.670
Wow! So many Shijimi clams!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:12.810
Did you collect all of these?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.520
I used a bit of my ninja techniques.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.750
I'll get some too!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:25.150
Can you really find shijimi at the beach?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.650
Who knows?

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:35.220
There are no shijimi clams in the sea.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:39.980
They live in rivers or lakes, as they are fresh water species.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.130
This is true.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:47.420
Aw, I didn't get any shijimi clams...

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.380
That's fine.

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.850
<i>Because you can't find them in the sea.</i>

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.450
Hey, hey, Sonya-chan.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:58.080
How many shijimi clams did you put in your bowl?

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:00.170
That doesn't matter, does it?

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.870
Are you mad that you lost?

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.960
I have 20 of 'em!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.610
Oh, a crab.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.160
Correct!

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:30.220
We're stuck here.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:33.330
It's close enough, so we can just swim.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.710
C'mon, Sonya-chan. Change out of your clothes!

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:40.670
Um, I don't have a swimsuit.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:50.450
Damn it! Damn it!

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:53.330
Why do I have to do this?

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.280
Shut up and keep swimming!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:58.200
I'd love to go around the world like this.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.580
That sounds good!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.730
No it doesn't!

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:02.450
C'mon! Let's go!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.030
No, no way!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.540
C'mon!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.100
No, keep swiming!

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:10.920
Another day.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.160
Good morning!

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:14.760
How are you?

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.130
Don't strangle me!

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:18.930
Let go!

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:21.460
You're still fine.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:24.640
What is this?

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.760
The puppets!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.330
It's getting popular lately!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.570
Yasuna's Troupe's First Public Performance!

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:34.530
You're doing it at a kindergarten for community service, aren't you?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:37.350
I made these back at home.

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:39.160
Hey, is that puppet...

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:42.150
I'm Sonya! Let's all get along!

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:44.290
Stop! Don't fight with yourself!

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:46.250
It doesn't look like me at all!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.470
It doesn't?

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.720
Then...

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.840
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.050
Don't do that, it's not good!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.700
Shut up! Be quiet!

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:57.680
What about now?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.390
That pisses me off!

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:06.530
It sure is nice outside!

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:09.470
It's just like my wallet!

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:11.160
How so?

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:13.070
Absolutely clear!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.350
Don't do that on my desk!

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:18.780
On top of that, your act sucks!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.080
Don't interrupt my training.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.660
<i>That's</i> what you're going to perform for the kindergarteners?!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:25.220
You little...

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:26.080
Again!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.080
Let go!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.570
My neck!

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.000
My finger! My finger's gonna break!

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:32.260
Release!

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:37.200
That's the substitution jutsu Agiri-san taught me!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.430
Liar.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:40.560
Now, what should I do with this?

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:44.120
W-Will you trade it for this?

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.030
Don't want it.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:47.420
Besides, you don't want my puppet?

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:49.520
N-No but...

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:54.300
I kinda want mine.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.870
Anyway, give it here.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:57.960
Here.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.210
Y-You threw them away...

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.810
There are other puppets for the performance, right?

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:11.510
I have a few more that I made.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:12.630
You don't have to take them out...

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:16.790
This is a prototype for yours, Sonyagator!

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:17.590
Don't name it that!

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.390
By the way, I'm a cat.

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.070
So cute!

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.780
Why am I an alligator and you're a cat?!

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:26.430
There's no way I'd be an alligator—

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.770
Ow...

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:34.190
Oh my, Sonya-chan, what big teeth you have!

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.530
All the better to eat you with!

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:39.120
Stop!

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.390
The way it feels in my mouth is...

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:44.920
Sonya-chan! I know you turned into an alligator, but still...!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:47.610
This is already turning to crap.

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:50.250
Shut up! Be quiet! I'm going to eat you!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.160
I'm bored.

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.270
Don't care.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.790
Let's practice together.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:55.790
Here.

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:01.260
So cute! So cute!

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:06.360
That's not cute!

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:11.680
You turned my puppet into an assassination tool...

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:14.370
It's a pretty nice way to cover up my knife.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.560
The birth of a puppet assassin?!

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.080
But it'd be suspicious if I had this on me.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.780
Ah! My Nyanpu!

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:24.580
You can have that one, so don't throw it away.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.240
Let's begin!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:31.360
I'm finally in the hands of my rightful owner!

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:32.630
Let's fight!

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:35.400
Don't hit the body!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:39.010
Didn't you want to fight?

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.220
It was a line from the play...

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:46.600
That was a nice head butt, but that won't be enough to take me down!

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.180
You're still going?

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.960
Oh! Nice!

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:52.100
I win.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:54.040
So mean!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.330
You weren't going to use it tomorrow anyway.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:57.340
Wait!

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.360
My puppet isn't dead yet!

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.280
Wh-What?

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.250
This is my true form!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.450
That's not a puppet anymore...

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.960
Can you defeat me now that I'm in my true form?

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.040
That's gross.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:18.130
I'll transform too, then.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:26.600
Dusk.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.520
Tomorrow'll be a huge hit.

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:33.110
I'll practice my autographs when I get home.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.790
When the kids come around to see me,

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.390
I'll tell them "Get in line! Get in line! Get in line! Get in line!"

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:39.980
Just kidding!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:43.650
I'm going to need to hire some bodyguards and have an autograph session.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.740
I'll make some CDs, some dramas, and there'll even be a movie.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:52.180
I'll win a bunch of awards, such as the participation award and the Nobel prize.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.010
Huh?

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:56.160
Sonya-chan, where did you go?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.340
I was going to let you be my secretary!

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:05.880
Hey! Sonya-chan! I'll give you some money when I win my Nobel prize!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:10.010
Bugs, Festival, Sea, Puppets.
